    {
      "title": "What is a Computer? 💻",
      "text": "A computer is a smart electronic machine made by humans! It runs on electricity, works very fast, remembers many things, and never gets tired!",
      "emoji": "🖥️",
      "bgColor": "from-blue-500 to-indigo-600",
      "spoken": "A computer is a smart electronic machine made by humans! It runs on electricity and works very fast!",
