            "Input",
            "Process",
            "Output",
            "Store"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "Parts of a Computer ⌨️",
      "text": "A computer has main parts working together! The Monitor is the screen, the CPU is the smart brain, the Keyboard is for typing, and the Mouse is for clicking!",
      "emoji": "🖱️",
      "bgColor": "from-cyan-500 to-blue-600",
      "spoken": "A computer has main parts! The monitor screen, the CPU brain, the keyboard, and the mouse!",
